<section class="panel-stack <%= panelClass('embed') %>" data-panel="embed">
  <article class="card section-panel">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Embed & Notice</p>
        <h3>임베드 및 공지</h3>
        <p class="muted">전송 형식에 따라 사용할 수 있는 입력 요소가 자동으로 바뀝니다.</p>
      </div>
      <label class="field toggle section-toggle">
        <input type="checkbox" form="embed-settings-form" name="embedEnabled" <%= settings.embed.enabled !== false ? 'checked' : '' %> />
        <span>임베드 기능 활성화</span>
      </label>
    </div>
    <form class="settings-form" id="embed-settings-form" method="post" action="/guild/<%= guild.id %>/settings/embed" data-embed-form>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <label class="field">
          <span>전송 형식</span>
          <select name="embedMode" data-embed-mode>
            <option value="components" <%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Components V2</option>
            <option value="legacy" <%= settings.embed.mode === 'legacy' ? 'selected' : '' %>>기본 임베드</option>
          </select>
          <small class="muted" data-embed-format-help>텍스트, 줄바꿈, 실선을 조합해 Discord Components V2 메시지를 만듭니다.</small>
        </label>
        <label class="field full">
          <span>전송 채널 검색</span>
          <input type="search" placeholder="이 탭에서 채널 이름을 입력해 검색" data-channel-search="embed-channel-select" autocomplete="off" />
          <select id="embed-channel-select" name="embedChannelId" data-embed-channel>
            <option value="">전송할 채널 선택</option>
            <% channels.text.forEach((channel) => { %>
              <option value="<%= channel.id %>" <%= settings.embed.channelId === channel.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= channel.label %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>제목</span>
          <input type="text" name="embedTitle" value="<%= settings.embed.title %>" data-embed-preview="title" />
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>색상</span>
          <input type="color" name="embedColor" value="<%= settings.embed.color %>" data-embed-preview="color" />
        </label>
        <label class="field full">
          <span>설명</span>
          <textarea name="embedDescription" rows="5" data-embed-preview="description"><%= settings.embed.description %></textarea>
        </label>

        <div class="field full" data-embed-format="components" style="<%= settings.embed.mode === 'legacy' ? 'display:none' : '' %>" aria-hidden="<%= settings.embed.mode === 'legacy' ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
          <span>메시지 내용</span>
          <textarea name="embedComponentsBody" rows="9" data-embed-preview="components"><%= settings.embed.componentsBody %></textarea>
          <small class="muted">입력한 순서대로 표시됩니다. 빈 줄은 줄바꿈, `---` 또는 `___`는 실선, `[image] https://이미지주소`는 큰 이미지, `[thumbnail] https://이미지주소`는 썸네일입니다. `@everyone`, `@here`, `<@&역할ID>`는 자동 멘션으로 변환됩니다.</small>
        </div>

        <div class="field full" data-embed-format="legacy" style="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'display:none' : '' %>" aria-hidden="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
          <span>푸터</span>
          <input type="text" name="embedFooter" value="<%= settings.embed.footer %>" />
        </div>
        <div class="field" data-embed-format="legacy" style="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'display:none' : '' %>" aria-hidden="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
          <span>작성자 이름</span>
          <input type="text" name="embedAuthorName" value="<%= settings.embed.authorName %>" />
        </div>
        <div class="field" data-embed-format="legacy" style="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'display:none' : '' %>" aria-hidden="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
          <span>작성자 링크</span>
          <input type="url" name="embedAuthorUrl" value="<%= settings.embed.authorUrl %>" />
        </div>
        <div class="field" data-embed-format="legacy" style="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'display:none' : '' %>" aria-hidden="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
          <span>썸네일 URL</span>
          <input type="url" name="embedThumbnailUrl" value="<%= settings.embed.thumbnailUrl %>" />
        </div>
        <div class="field" data-embed-format="legacy" style="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'display:none' : '' %>" aria-hidden="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
          <span>이미지 URL</span>
          <input type="url" name="embedImageUrl" value="<%= settings.embed.imageUrl %>" />
        </div>
        <div class="field full" data-embed-format="legacy" style="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'display:none' : '' %>" aria-hidden="<%= settings.embed.mode !== 'legacy' ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
          <span>필드</span>
          <textarea name="embedFields" rows="5"><%= JSON.stringify(settings.embed.fields || []) %></textarea>
          <small class="muted">JSON 형식: [{"name":"항목명","value":"내용","inline":true}] · 최대 25개</small>
        </div>

        <label class="field check-field full">
          <input type="checkbox" name="embedScheduleEnabled" <%= settings.embed.scheduleEnabled ? 'checked' : '' %> />
          <span>주기적으로 자동 전송</span>
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>전송 주기(분)</span>
          <input type="number" min="1" max="10080" name="embedScheduleIntervalMinutes" value="<%= settings.embed.scheduleIntervalMinutes %>" />
        </label>
      </div>
      <div class="form-actions">
        <button class="primary" type="submit">설정 저장</button>
        <button class="ghost" type="button" data-embed-send data-send-url="/guild/<%= guild.id %>/embed/send">지금 전송</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </article>
  <aside class="preview-column">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="section-head compact">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Discord Preview</p><h3>실제 메시지 미리보기</h3></div>
      </div>
      <div class="discord-message" data-embed-preview-card>
        <div class="discord-avatar"><%= guild.name.slice(0, 1) %></div>
        <div class="discord-message-content">
          <div class="discord-message-meta"><strong><%= guild.name %></strong><span>오늘 오전 12:00</span></div>
          <div class="discord-message-text" data-embed-preview-description-text><%= settings.embed.description %></div>
          <div class="discord-components-message" data-embed-preview-components-card>
            <div class="discord-components-preview" data-embed-preview-components></div>
          </div>
          <div class="discord-embed-card" data-embed-preview-legacy-card>
            <div class="discord-embed-accent"></div>
            <div class="discord-embed-inner">
              <h4 data-embed-preview-title><%= settings.embed.title %></h4>
              <p data-embed-preview-description><%= settings.embed.description %></p>
              <div class="discord-embed-footer"><%= settings.embed.footer || guild.name %></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="muted preview-help">Discord의 어두운 메시지 레이아웃을 기준으로 표시합니다.</p>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>
